    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Stokes Quirke are delighted to bring to the market this spacious and well-maintained 3-bedroom terraced residence situated in the centrally located Westgate Court, Clonmel. This beautifully finished home offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to first-time purchasers, investors or those seeking a conveniently located residence. The accommodation is laid out over two floors and comprises an entrance hallway, spacious sitting room, kitchen/dining area, three generously sized bedrooms together with three bathrooms, providing comfortable and practical living accommodation throughout. The property has been well cared for and enjoys a pleasant residential setting within easy reach of Clonmel town centre. To the rear you can enjoy an enclosed garden with the benefit of pedestrian access. Early viewing is advised. \n\nAccommodation\n\nHallway\n4.99m x 1.91m Timber flooring with a carpet staircase and W.C.\n\nWC\n0.79m x 1.40m Tiled flooring, W.C, W.H.B\n\nSitting Room\n3.18m x 4.40m Timber flooring with a gas fireplace and window overlooking the front.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room\n5.20m x 3.80m Tiled flooring and backsplash, units at eye and floor level with plumbing for washing machine and dishwasher. Large window and sliding door to the rear garden\n\nFirst Floor\n\n\nLanding\n2.11m x 3.52m Carpet flooring, hot-press thereof.\n\nBathroom\n2.08m x 2.09m Tiled flooring, W.C, W.H.B, and shower\n\nBedroom 1\n2.95m x 3.22m Timber flooring with a window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 2\n2.93m x 4.05m Timber flooring with a window overlooking the front. En-Suite thereof.\n\nEn-suite\n1.90m x 1.66m Tiled flooring W.C, W.H.B and shower\n\nBedroom 3\n2.11m x 2.86m Timber flooring with a window overlooking the front.\n\n\nOutside\nOutside, the property benefits from a private enclosed rear garden offering a low-maintenance outdoor space ideal for everyday use and entertaining."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Central location within easy walking distance of all amenities \nIn excellent decorative order\nEnclosed rear garden with pedestrian access \n \n Gas FCH with all mains connections \n The property is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, sporting facilities and healthcare services, while Clonmel town centre is just a short distance away."
      },
